            "review_text": "Toughasnail\nGold Coast, Australia5 contributions\n0\nYummy Bo Kho\nSep 2016\nOn a busy street walking distance to backpacker area in HCM city. Serve mainly egg noodle and wonton soups. Their best dish is \"bo kho\", you can have it with bread or rice noodle or egg noodle.\nA bit small but clean and air conditioned. Not expensive either\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 7, 2016",
