            "review_text": "SDJen\nSan Diego, California83 contributions\n0\nWonton Noodle soup that is AMAZING\nAug 2014 • Solo\nI kind of feel bad for not writing this review last year as I was sitting in the restaurant. Food is great and cheap. There is also aircon which makes a huge difference to the dining experience. We all ordered a different item on the menu and were more than happy and satisfied. If you come to HCM you have to check it out. Trust me. Happy travels! \n\nXOXOXOXO\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 21, 2015",
